  "assistance": "AI-assisted (Claude): the TypeScript generator generators/dc-national-cathedral.ts was written from the open evidence in the modelling notes (OSM, public lidar and aerials, licensed photographs, published dimensions), reviewed by a human against reference photos, and exported deterministically. No photographic textures.",
  "review": {
